  "__comment": [
    "plny_tengu_helmet.json — Tengu War Helm with back-mounted wings.",
    "",
    "COORDINATE SYSTEM (0–16 unit grid, Minecraft item model space):",
    "  +X = right,  +Y = up,  +Z = south / toward the back of the",
    "  player when the item is displayed in the HEAD slot.",
    "  Therefore elements at Z ≥ 13 appear on the player's back.",
    "",
    "TEXTURES:",
    "  #helmet → plugins/Oraxen/pack/textures/custom/plny_tengu_set/plny_tengu_helmet.png",
    "  #wings  → plugins/Oraxen/pack/textures/custom/plny_tengu_set/plny_tengu_wings.png",
    "",
    "DISPLAY TRANSFORM TUNING:",
    "  The 'head' transform uses scale [1,1,1] as a starting point.",
    "  If the helmet appears too large in-game, lower the scale, e.g.:",
    "    scale: [0.625, 0.625, 0.625]",
    "  Use Blockbench (File → Open / Load model) to preview and tweak.",
    "",
    "WINGS ORIENTATION:",
    "  The wing elements (wing_spine, left_wing_*, right_wing_*) are",
    "  positioned at Z = 13–16, directly behind the helmet body.",
    "  When worn in the HEAD slot, high-Z in the model space aligns",
    "  with the player's back, so the wings visually extend from the",
    "  back/shoulders without needing a second equipped item or /hat."
